==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 2 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Venusaur Drop Event]], which ran from November 29 to December 13, 2024.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Surprise Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Brock's Diglett|67}} from {{TCG|Gym Challenge}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

